  (text "J2 pin numbers are the ProFile cable's; the drive is the socket end.\nR14 keeps PH0 low with no cable attached. Pin 7 is N/C on the ProFile and the //e card, so it\nis not used: U3 B6 is grounded and U1 pin 104 (the C/D partner of PRES_N's pin 102) is open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 256.54 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e6f6f52-cfa9-5219-846b-e8e81d6291da"))
