  (text "R49 to R52: U3's host-side inputs (PCMD_N, PSTRB_N, PRW, PRES_N) idle high with no cable or the host off.\nTI requires a 74LVC245A's inputs held at a rail (PH0 has R14 to GND; B6 to B8 are grounded)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 281.94 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e6b9d197-25ee-4696-89a7-7dcfa258c68b"))
