  (text "U3 is held off (OE high, R53) until the gateware drives U3_OE_N low after configuration:\nU1 pins 97/99 are an ECP5 A/B pair. The pair must not be driven apart\nbefore the core supply passes POR (Lattice FPGA-DS-02012 3.6). The host can hold them apart." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 76.2 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2971e6bd-db14-4920-94f4-9c9d4f6e26e0"))
